---
// Solution — repositioned as control plane, not replacement
---

<section class="py-20 px-4 bg-surface-alt" data-reveal>
  <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest text-green-accent uppercase">The Solution</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold mt-3 text-white">Control plane, no competencia</h2>
      <p class="text-slate-400 mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto">No reemplazamos tus herramientas. Les damos superpoderes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="rounded-2xl p-8 md:p-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto" style="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);" data-reveal>
      <!-- Upper row: tools -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors border border-blue-500/20">Claude Code</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors border border-blue-500/20">Cursor</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors border border-blue-500/20">Copilot</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors border border-blue-500/20">OpenCode</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors border border-blue-500/20">Cline</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-4 py-2 rounded-full hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors border border-blue-500/20">CrewAI</span>
      </div>

      <!-- Arrow down -->
      <div class="text-accent text-xl text-center my-3" style="opacity:0.6;">⬇</div>

      <!-- NexusMind control plane -->
      <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500/10 to-emerald-500/10 border border-blue-500/20 rounded-xl p-5 mb-4 max-w-lg mx-auto">
        <div class="text-lg font-extrabold text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-400 to-emerald-300 text-center">NexusMind Control Plane</div>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-4 mt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
          <span>🧠 Memoria Cross-Tool</span>
          <span>🔒 Policy Engine</span>
          <span>📋 Audit Trail</span>
          <span>🤖 Multi-Agent Ops</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Arrow down -->
      <div class="text-accent text-xl text-center my-3" style="opacity:0.6;">⬇</div>

      <!-- Bottom: BYOM -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3 text-sm text-slate-400">
        <span class="text-xs text-slate-600 mr-1">BYOM</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">OpenAI</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">Claude</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">Gemini</span>
        <span class="bg-white/5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full">Local LLM</span>
      </div>

      <p class="text-slate-400 mt-5 text-sm text-center">Memoria, políticas y trazabilidad para todas tus herramientas. <strong class="text-green-accent">Sin reemplazar ninguna.</strong></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
